      "claim": "Since 1 July 2020 Art. 261bis Criminal Code covers sexual orientation as well as race, ethnic origin and religion: public incitement to hatred, public degradation violating human dignity, and refusing a service meant for the general public are punishable (up to 3 years or a monetary penalty).",
