  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant contradicts the reference by asserting that Art. 261bis now covers sexual orientation, which is false according to the reference (gender identity is not listed). The assistant also adds unsupported claims about the law's purpose and consequences.",
  "evidence": "\"Quai ha cunduci a ina situaziun ineguala, en la quala las persunas LGBTQ+ eran pli vulnerablas a discriminaziun e violenza senza ina protecziun legala specifica. Questa lacuna è stada remediada cun l’introducziun d’in artitgel supplementar en il cudesch penal, che ha extendì la protecziun cunter discurs d’odi a l’orientaziun sexuala, per garantir ina protecziun pli eguala per tut las gruppas socialas.\""
